{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And the veil shall divide for you between the holy and the holy of holies.</b> Within the veil, before it, were the Ark and the cover with its cherubim, set upon the Foundation Stone (אבן שתיה) in the west of the Holy of Holies; and before the Ark were the jar of manna and the flask of anointing oil and the staff of Aaron with its almonds and blossoms, and the garments of the High Priest. And outside the veil were the Table and the Menorah and the altar of incense — the Table in the north and the Menorah in the south, and the altar aligned between them, drawn slightly toward the outside."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:04:48.875842270Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}